MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- pm.environments registers the dependency tree only when hermes_bootstrap installed the
  attestation (never imports a module an older/partial launch closure lacks); startup
  inventory and launcher fixtures list code_attestation, local_work, _launch_template.
- TrackedThread subclasses the stdlib Thread resolved via the main thread's MRO; a replaced
  threading.Thread is honoured and latches 'threading-thread-replaced' unknown coverage.
- run_in_pool(None) submits to the loop's scope-aware default executor.
- Facade/review wrappers dispatch through the class so stand-in agents keep working.
- Reservation labels never raise on partially built adapters (_work_label).
- resolve_channel_skills stays importable from gateway.platforms.base (plugin boundary).
- Revert accidentally committed */cache/plugin_hooks.json test artifacts.
